    "detailed_description": "Aurascope is a 2D action-adventure collectathon platformer with light puzzle and RPG elements developed by Nick Oztok. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/e5205cd441862ba260064d5e9accf096.poster.avif?t=1742681171\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/e5205cd441862ba260064d5e9accf096.webm?t=1742681171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/e5205cd441862ba260064d5e9accf096.mp4?t=1742681171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Join our friends <strong>Trace and Aurora</strong> to uncover the secrets surrounding the <strong>Aurascope</strong>, a mysterious drive from beyond the stars! Use it's abilities to help collect <strong>Energy Cores</strong> scattered throughout the lands to restore power to the Islands of Starlight! Utilize the duo's arsenal of skills to collect goodies, explore, battle foes big and small, and embark on an adventure of a lifetime!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Discover the secrets behind the Aurascope and complete the epic story in Adventure mode.<br></li><li> Play alongside or against your friends in head-to-head matches in battle mode.<br></li><li> Keep yourself entertained with a variety of fun challenge modes.<br></li><li> Race your friend\u2019s best course clear times with holos.<br></li><li> Customize the game to suit your personal preferences and gameplay style. </li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/72984360379b16389a88f2d787b893be.avif?t=1742681171\" /></div><br>\u2b50 <strong>Use the Aurascope to interact with objects, attack enemies, as a jump boost, and more!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/fce8fb9babde75ee2ebfc7d32c4ae4a8.poster.avif?t=1742681171\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/fce8fb9babde75ee2ebfc7d32c4ae4a8.webm?t=1742681171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/fce8fb9babde75ee2ebfc7d32c4ae4a8.mp4?t=1742681171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u2b50 <strong>Acquire Energy Cores to help bring power back to the Islands of Starlight!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/d6d4a5dd2329123b04726b20de5b6fc4.poster.avif?t=1742681171\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/d6d4a5dd2329123b04726b20de5b6fc4.webm?t=1742681171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/d6d4a5dd2329123b04726b20de5b6fc4.mp4?t=1742681171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u2b50 <strong>Collect and utilize all sorts of different items to help you along your journey!</strong> <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/5b632f606a17e81f487dc83dc74d1dff.poster.avif?t=1742681171\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/5b632f606a17e81f487dc83dc74d1dff.webm?t=1742681171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/5b632f606a17e81f487dc83dc74d1dff.mp4?t=1742681171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/c6123642cc23aafd42127f020ce50b85.avif?t=1742681171\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/b9ec83b6ec5b3b96ae7302c551d38c60.webp?t=1742681171\" /></div><br><strong>Trace</strong> is a lean, mean, - and with his mechanical arms, perhaps literal - platforming machine. With a wide array of moves and techniques at his disposal, he can traverse nearly any location with ease! Even without the Aurascope\u2019s abilities, he is still an extremely agile and trailblazing adventurer with a big heart.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/b338d731b68624b4921c85be4310871a.webp?t=1742681171\" /></div><br><strong>Aurora</strong> is an extraordinary engineer and inventor. She never shies away from adventure and may be even more of a daredevil than Trace. She is equipped with several unique inventions of her own design in addition to being able to use the Aurascope. Her smarts and determination are what get her through the toughest situations!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/f2bdfd981d6ba1baefd704d16d31d8e9.avif?t=1742681171\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/7888645f649f587fd53369811ea0845c.avif?t=1742681171\" /></div><br><strong>To put it simply, my goal for Aurascope is make one of the best indie platformers out there!</strong><br><br>Ever since I was a kid and my sister bought me my first console I absolutely fell in love with videogames. I told myself one day I'll make my own game and that's exactly what I'm doing here with Aurascope! <br><br>Aurascope's intention as a game is to make the player feel a sense of wonder and enjoyment! Taking the best of what platformers do while at the same time adding more oomph to it. Plenty of content, care, polish, and more to make sure this game is something memorable, replayable, and most importantly fun! Accessibility is key, because at the end of the day we all want to have a good time and enjoy ourselves. Whether you like to take your time and play games casually or if you're a dedicated speedrunner who likes to blast their way through levels, Aurascope aims to provide an unforgettable experience to everyone!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/e0ce61f6f535fd28e956e86a9d235463.poster.avif?t=1742681171\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/e0ce61f6f535fd28e956e86a9d235463.webm?t=1742681171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/e0ce61f6f535fd28e956e86a9d235463.mp4?t=1742681171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/b77301f598830c5621b0b482bf879e5d.avif?t=1742681171\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Aurascope is a 2D action-adventure collectathon platformer with light puzzle and RPG elements developed by Nick Oztok. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/e5205cd441862ba260064d5e9accf096.poster.avif?t=1742681171\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/e5205cd441862ba260064d5e9accf096.webm?t=1742681171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/e5205cd441862ba260064d5e9accf096.mp4?t=1742681171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Join our friends <strong>Trace and Aurora</strong> to uncover the secrets surrounding the <strong>Aurascope</strong>, a mysterious drive from beyond the stars! Use it's abilities to help collect <strong>Energy Cores</strong> scattered throughout the lands to restore power to the Islands of Starlight! Utilize the duo's arsenal of skills to collect goodies, explore, battle foes big and small, and embark on an adventure of a lifetime!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Discover the secrets behind the Aurascope and complete the epic story in Adventure mode.<br></li><li> Play alongside or against your friends in head-to-head matches in battle mode.<br></li><li> Keep yourself entertained with a variety of fun challenge modes.<br></li><li> Race your friend\u2019s best course clear times with holos.<br></li><li> Customize the game to suit your personal preferences and gameplay style. </li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547880/extras/72984360379b16389a88f2d787b893be.avif?t=1742681171\" /></div><br>\u2b50 <strong>Use the Aurascope to interact with objects, attack enemies, as a jump boost, and more!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><